ironments the mechaina's skin are  essentially like green while the sullies  are a much darker shade of blue this  adds an extra layer of racism and  classism to the movie's events it also  creates complications in mounting a  revolution since past bigotrys can make  it hard to bring disparate communities  to fight together against their common  oppressors even when it's necessary but  as the film shows at the end when King  tonawari says that Jake and his family  are now metcaina after they fight  together banding together and looking  past bigotry is possible  [Music]

